Wed Nov 18 15:28:14 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Build with external native debug symbols, merged back into the
  binaries before packaging: the jmods no longer carry debug info,
  the -debuginfo packages stay as they were (bsc#1282358)
- Check the debug symbols with eu-readelf instead of nm
- Keep internal debug symbols on SLE12: its eu-unstrip
  (elfutils 0.158) cannot merge them

